function statusDeclarations(text){const names=['烈焰诅咒','致命诅咒','虚弱诅咒','山神守护','麻痹','中毒','烧伤','寄生','冻伤','害怕','疲惫','睡眠','石化','混乱','衰弱','易燃','狂暴','冰封','流血','瘫痪','失明','焚烬','诅咒','感染','束缚','失神','沉默','臣服','凝滞','星赐','星哲','超频','沸涌','砥砺','星赎','神游','空定','狂信','雷解','渐冻','魇昧'];const out=[];for(const name of names){const at=String(text??'').indexOf(name);if(at<0)continue;const prefix=text.slice(Math.max(0,text.lastIndexOf('；',at)+1),at);if(!/(?:令|使|概率|命中后)/.test(prefix))continue;const percentages=[...prefix.matchAll(/(\d+)%/g)];out.push({name,chance:percentages.length?Number(percentages.at(-1)[1]):100});}return out;}
function compileInstances(instances,effects,move=null){const operations=[];
 for(let index=0;index<instances.length;index++){const instance=instances[index],rule=registry[instance.id],entry=effects.find(e=>e.id===instance.id);if(!rule)return {issue:`未实现的效果 ID：${instance.id}`,operations:[]};
 if(rule.singleStagePending)return {issue:`效果 ${instance.id} 单精灵分支未完成：${rule.singleStagePending}`,operations:[]};
 if(!entry||((![1425,1602].includes(instance.id))&&!templateMatches(instance.id,entry.template))||((![1425,1602].includes(instance.id))&&entry.argsNum!==rule.argsNum))return {issue:`效果 ${instance.id} 模板不匹配`,operations:[]};
